  "prefLabel": "Gal 301.04 Certifying board",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-10-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gal 301.04 “Certifying board” means any public board, committee, commission, agency, or other public body that certifies, registers or licenses guardians ad litem, other than an appointing court.\n\nSource. #8101, eff 1-1-05; ss by #8942, eff 9-15-07, EXPIRED: 9-15-15\n\nNew. #11075, INTERIM, eff 4-18-16, EXPIRED: 10-15-16\n\nNew. #12010, eff 10-21-16",
